OL,3,AHundreds of flights cancelled at UK
OL,4,Aairports as air traffic control issue
OL,5,Acauses widespread disruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FAirports across the UK are seeing
OL,8,Fflight delays and cancellations due to
OL,9,Fan
OL,11,Fissue with air traffic control
OL,13,FAir traffic controller Nats says the
OL,14,Fissue is with its "flight processing
OL,15,Fsystem" - and that a fix has been
OL,16,Fdeployed
OL,18,FHeathrow, Gatwick and East Midlands
OL,19,Fairports are affected, with Manchester
OL,20,Fairport warning of potential delays,
OL,21,Fwrites our correspondent
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
